   {
    "id": "dairokuten",
    "category": "shrine",
    "name": {
     "en": "Kami-Takaido Dairokuten Shrine",
     "ja": "上高井戸第六天神社"
    },
    "about": {
     "en": "Its stone guardian lions, dated 1771, are said to be the oldest outdoor pair in Suginami, and its main hall, rebuilt in 1856, is richly carved. In 1972 the buildings were moved slightly north for the Chūō Expressway, whose elevated road now runs right past the torii.",
     "ja": "1771年銘の狛犬は区内で最も古い屋外の一対といわれ、1856年再建の本殿には精緻な彫刻が施されている。1972年、中央自動車道の建設で社殿が少し北へ移され、今は鳥居のすぐ脇を高架が通る。"
    },
    "location": [
     35.67903,
     139.61217
    ],
    "checked": "2026-09-23",
    "source": {
